35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The roads north were shut for eleven days, but halls kept their timetables.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The outer wards lost their bus link; residents face an hour's round trip.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The old digitisation project left half the images unindexed.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The vehicle running line overran by a third last year.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"We have retired tradespeople, but no one trained to supervise outside facilitators.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, that bus loss is severe. It isolates those wards completely.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, yes. And evening bookings are full, but remote use peaks later.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, if vehicles are expensive, maybe a mobile service is risky.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, the grant only covers fees for twelve months, then it's on us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, the partner-run groups still meet unaided, which is promising.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The community halls seem more resilient than our fixed branches.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,We need to consider how to reach those without transport.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,The attendance at former outreach stops was actually higher than midweek main branch.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The endowment covers capital, but operating costs are a flat budget.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,"The tool certification technician retired, which is a gap for workshops.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,We must ensure whatever we choose doesn't depend on fragile conditions.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"A mobile service might solve the transport issue, but is it sustainable?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,"The records show outreach works, but we need to check the costs.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"If the running costs are high, a vehicle might be a financial trap.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,We lack the supervision skills for complex new programs like language circles.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
