60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"The candidates are Mobile Branch, Maker Workshop, Language Circles, and Digital Archive.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,The Mobile Branch addresses the bus link loss directly.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,The Digital Archive failed before; the Mobile Branch has good attendance data.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The Mobile Branch has high running costs, but the grant helps initially.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minako,,Language Circles need facilitators we don't have; Mobile Branch uses existing staff.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, the Mobile Branch seems to fit the need for access.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, yes, but @Benjamin, what about the long-term costs?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Minako, the Mobile Branch doesn't need new supervision skills, just drivers.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Jonathan, the running line overran, but it's less than building a new branch.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, correct. The staff can handle the help desk with current training.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"The winter closures didn't stop the halls, so a vehicle might be flexible.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,It brings the service to the people who can't come to us.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,The attendance sheets prove people want this service.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,It's the most logical use of the current budget structure.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minako,,It avoids the skill gaps of the other proposals.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I am convinced the Mobile Branch is the most resilient option.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. It solves the access problem without new infrastructure.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Rin,,The data supports it. Let's go with the Mobile Branch.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,The financial risk is manageable compared to the others.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Minako,,It is the only one we can staff with current capabilities.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
